# 🏗️ BASE RULES - PROTECTED ASSET

## ⚠️ CRITICAL: NEVER DELETE OR MODIFY WITHOUT EXPLICIT PERMISSION

### 🎯 PROJECT STACK & STANDARDS
- **Stack**: Next.js (App Router) + React + TypeScript (strict) + Tailwind + MDX (blog)
- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router
- **Language**: TypeScript with strict mode enabled
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4
- **Content**: MDX for blog posts
- **Internationalization**: next-intl

### 📚 LIBRARY MANAGEMENT RULES

#### **Library Addition Policy**
- **Älä lisää kirjastoja omin päin** (Don't add libraries on your own)
- **Jos ehdotat lisäystä** (If you suggest an addition):
  - Tarjoa perustelu (Provide justification)
  - Tarjoa vaihtoehto (Provide alternative)
  - Tarjoa poistosuunnitelma (Provide removal plan)

#### **Approval Process**
- All library additions require explicit user approval
- Document why the library is needed
- Provide alternative solutions
- Plan for removal if not needed

### 🔧 CODE QUALITY STANDARDS

#### **ESLint + Prettier**
- **Noudata repo-konfigeja** (Follow repository configurations)
- **Korjaa linter-valitukset ennen PR:ää** (Fix linter complaints before PR)
- Use existing ESLint and Prettier configurations
- No linting errors allowed in pull requests

#### **TypeScript Standards**
- **Strict mode**: Always enabled
- **Type safety**: All components and functions must be typed
- **No any types**: Use proper TypeScript interfaces

### 🎨 FONT CONFIGURATION

#### **Font Setup Requirements**
- **Käytä next/font/google** (Use next/font/google)
- **Aseta Playfair Display (headings) & Inter (body) root-layouteissa** (Set Playfair Display for headings & Inter for body in root layouts)
- **Implementation**:
  ```tsx
  import { Inter, Playfair_Display } from 'next/font/google'
  
  const inter = Inter({ subsets: ['latin'] })
  const playfair = Playfair_Display({ subsets: ['latin'] })
  ```

### ⚛️ REACT COMPONENT ARCHITECTURE

#### **Server vs Client Components**
- **Server Components oletuksena** (Server Components by default)
- **Client-komponentit vain kun pakko** (Client components only when necessary - interaction)
- Use Server Components for static content
- Use Client Components only for interactive elements

### 🎨 STYLING STANDARDS

#### **Tailwind CSS Usage**
- **UI = Tailwind; ei inline-tyylejä** (UI = Tailwind; no inline styles)
- **Vakioluokat**: kontti, spacing, typohierarkia @styles (Standard classes: container, spacing, typography hierarchy @styles)
- Use Tailwind utility classes exclusively
- No inline styles or custom CSS
- Follow established design system patterns

### 📄 COMPONENT & PAGE CREATION

#### **Template Usage**
- **Kun luot "uuden sivun/komponentin", käytä @templates-tiedostoja** (When creating "new page/component", use @templates files)
- Always reference template files for new components
- Follow established patterns and structures
- Maintain consistency across the project

### 📁 CRITICAL DIRECTORIES
- `src/` - Source code (NEVER DELETE)
- `content/` - Blog and content (NEVER DELETE)
- `public/` - Static assets (NEVER DELETE)
- `rules/` - Project rules (NEVER DELETE)

